cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "uwlight: inherent optical properties of Jerlov water types, with provenance"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it. Please also cite the underlying
  data sources, which are listed with their DOIs in DATA.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ishibashi
    given-names: T.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1711-9908"
version: 0.1.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22321312"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tishibashi-cpu/uwlight"
abstract: >-
  Absorption and scattering coefficients for the Jerlov optical water types,
  taken from the primary literature with the provenance of every value
  recorded. Values that a published table got wrong are flagged rather than
  silently repaired, and quantities the data do not determine are refused
  rather than guessed.
keywords:
  - ocean optics
  - Jerlov water types
  - inherent optical properties
  - underwater imaging
  - underwater visibility
